@startuml lld-us14-state
title LLD-US14 Send money by IMPS: state machine
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty description
state INITIATED
state OTP_PENDING
state SUBMITTED
state SUCCESS
state FAILED
[*] --> INITIATED
INITIATED --> OTP_PENDING : limit ok
OTP_PENDING --> SUBMITTED : OTP correct
OTP_PENDING --> FAILED : OTP wrong 3 times
SUBMITTED --> SUCCESS : NPCI success
SUBMITTED --> FAILED : NPCI reject
SUBMITTED --> FAILED : no reply in 60 s
@enduml